  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice celery. Zest lime to get a generous pinch and cut into wedges.\n• Pick and roughly chop mint. Thinly slice long chilli (if using).\n• Cut Malaysian tofu into 2cm chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/639a7ee25a6e8e82010067ce/step-26a84c51.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook tofu, tossing, until browned and warmed through, 3-4 minutes. Transfer to a bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/639a7ee25a6e8e82010067ce/step-e8a731c7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While tofu is cooking, combine sweet chilli sauce, lime zest and mayonnaise in a small bowl. Set aside.\n• In a medium bowl, combine slaw mix, celery, mint, a squeeze of lime juice and a drizzle of olive oil. Season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.\n• Microwave mini flourtortillas on a plate for 10 second bursts, or until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/639a7ee25a6e8e82010067ce/step-4fc0e654.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread some sweet chilli mayo over tortillas. Top with some mint slaw and tofu. Drizzle over sesame dressing.\n• Sprinkle with crispy shallots and chilli (if using) to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/639a7ee25a6e8e82010067ce/step-59661560.jpg"
    }
  ]
